    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報370期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目一nih，koh beh到正月時仔。Lán tuè世界沓沓仔〈成長〉，mā想beh知影〈幸福是啥mi̍h〉。幸福，凡勢是〈囡仔時代ê新正年頭〉去都市tshit-thô ê記持；是年尾參一家伙仔做伙〈大piànn掃〉；mā無的確是聽〈散仙阿公〉講起íng過ê人生故事。〈魚翅筒仔kā tshānn--落-去〉，配〈芋仔西米露〉、〈兩款sá-la〉tsia-ê好料，mā ē hōo人幸福ê感覺。個人ê幸福是lim食thit，眾人ê幸福是健全ê民主環境——〈歹路m̄-thang行——韓國總統ê àu戲拖棚kap部份同胞ê引喻失當〉、〈王梨老師ê第一屆「全國台語政策民間會議」筆記〉，邀請逐家鬥陣關心台灣社會各項議題，平安順序tsiah thang久久長長。&nbsp;</span></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhpmDqFv_vJw98iLLyKbp-iP1M8RpXo0kbpa3h8kkIyOfvTFBSpZzQc9b4guBNZVl12MMXRZ5O79iUyfjLFVr8xwHh4qr3paZ0pqPkGi1T3qH8EUE7wewwSPXHMio1HbJcoLlUdZmuKth60A4bDkNlmxMGBxmrt5Y2dYSfPAX-zINjPBGdTZphmeB2LevPx/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E9%83%A8.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhpmDqFv_vJw98iLLyKbp-iP1M8RpXo0kbpa3h8kkIyOfvTFBSpZzQc9b4guBNZVl12MMXRZ5O79iUyfjLFVr8xwHh4qr3paZ0pqPkGi1T3qH8EUE7wewwSPXHMio1HbJcoLlUdZmuKth60A4bDkNlmxMGBxmrt5Y2dYSfPAX-zINjPBGdTZphmeB2LevPx/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E9%83%A8.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEho_NJb6Iy6OuvA8Jx7YHRcAyJBoZ6cpxm_7cQvnh2-sQTbq1xBRM5Z1nh77keV8mSsCzoILZi4S0H1b3MH0DGX5mojieJVFOJ7